### SnapTask API — click "Send Request" above any block (VS Code REST Client extension)
### Run them top to bottom. After "Log in", copy the token from the response
### into the @token line below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@workspaceId = PASTE_WORKSPACE_ID_HERE
@taskId = PASTE_TASK_ID_HERE

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Sign up  ->  returns { user, token }
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sai Ramadoss",
  "email": "sai@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Log in  ->  returns { user, token }   (copy token into @token above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sai@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Who am I  (protected — proves the token works)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a workspace  ->  copy workspace.id into @workspaceId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Product Team" }

### List my workspaces
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invite a member by email  (owner only — sign up a 2nd user first to test)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "teammate@example.com" }

### Create a task  ->  copy task.id into @taskId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspaceId": "{{workspaceId}}",
  "title": "Write API docs for the /tasks endpoints",
  "priority": "high"
}

### List tasks in the workspace
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?workspaceId={{workspaceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one task
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Move the task to In Progress
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "in-progress" }

### Delete the task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No token  ->  should return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces
